# Milestone: M3
# Covers: detached runners (','  separator) reading and writing shared environment;
#         fire-and-forget strand sees outer variable at fork time and after write.
# defer-to: M5 (chk runner needs urbi_step driver path for ',' separator)
#
# Reason:
#   ',' (OP_FORK_DETACH) requires the realm-managed scheduler path; not available
#   in the urbi_vm_run REPL (realm == NULL).  See tests/chk/separator/comma_amp_unsupported.chk.
#   Cross-strand shared-environment semantics (§7.1 shared-frame) are additionally
#   deferred to M5 design-risks-7 resolution.
#
# Original urbiscript (activate at M5 with urbi_step chk driver):
# # { var x = 0; { x.print() }, x.print() };
# # [00000001] 0
# # [00000002] 0
# # { var x = 0; { x = 42 }, sleep(100ms); x.print() };
# # [00000003] 42
